{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Welcome To UltraSpace!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877480/extras/262b5e3f0f84bb17ff432fb481dfaf31.poster.avif?t=1755343188\" width=780 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877480/extras/262b5e3f0f84bb17ff432fb481dfaf31.webm?t=1755343188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877480/extras/262b5e3f0f84bb17ff432fb481dfaf31.mp4?t=1755343188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UltraPets Online is a genre-defining Creature Collecting game that blends RTS, Pet Sim, RPG and MOBA Elements with Smart AI Creatures to achieve exciting Competitive battling and Immersive Gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take on the role of a Trainer in Ultraspace! A network of worlds to discover and explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture</strong>, <strong>Raise</strong> and <strong>Battle</strong> unique AI controlled creatures called Ultrapets. Each creature has a procedurally generated personality from over 1.2 Million Data Points - guaranteeing a unique companion with each capture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877480/extras/99f0bdcfd623b4f7c196a58f6f23d32a.poster.avif?t=1755343188\" width=780 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877480/extras/99f0bdcfd623b4f7c196a58f6f23d32a.webm?t=1755343188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877480/extras/99f0bdcfd623b4f7c196a58f6f23d32a.mp4?t=1755343188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your pet's mood, diet, environment and training to nurture the perfect partners to challenge the world of ULTRAPETS Online!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877480/extras/bb34cf0fd4de6153190c8705fb433009.poster.avif?t=1755343188\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877480/extras/bb34cf0fd4de6153190c8705fb433009.webm?t=1755343188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877480/extras/bb34cf0fd4de6153190c8705fb433009.mp4?t=1755343188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is played in Real-Time Online along side your pets, so good planning,  mechanical skill and a fateful meeting with the right partner are necessary to be the best. Over 32 Attacks in the demo, each with complex physics interactions with other moves and the environment.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877480/extras/3805bbc8e22d6d3187223647cc2018b7.poster.avif?t=1755343188\" width=780 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877480/extras/3805bbc8e22d6d3187223647cc2018b7.webm?t=1755343188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877480/extras/3805bbc8e22d6d3187223647cc2018b7.mp4?t=1755343188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your way to the top you'll meet other trainers with similar ambitions. You'll also meet powerful pets and uncover their role in the fabric of UltraSpace!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877480/extras/1f4a42c5e8697cebc4f003c237e85899.poster.avif?t=1755343188\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877480/extras/1f4a42c5e8697cebc4f003c237e85899.webm?t=1755343188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877480/extras/1f4a42c5e8697cebc4f003c237e85899.mp4?t=1755343188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3877480?t=1755343188","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877480/bd5c55346d5d68cc3db031984fbfc191ac04d202/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755343188","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877480/bb2728f38c3a3927637b4c2b5538b514d5bc9e31/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755343188","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877480/bb2728f38c3a3927637b4c2b5538b514d5bc9e31/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755343188","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Welcome To UltraSpace!</strong></h2><p cla